# Placeholder so the certs/ directory exists in the Docker build context.
#
# If you build behind a TLS-inspection proxy (e.g. Zscaler), drop the proxy's
# root CA here as a .crt file (PEM encoded). It is installed into the builder
# stages' trust store so npm/node-gyp/prebuild-install can fetch over HTTPS.
# The runtime image does NOT include it. Real certs are gitignored.
